  {
   "id": "DP-01",
   "severity": "amber",
   "area": "Packers depth",
   "finding": "59 of 59 published Packers rows still carry the jersey number inside the name field (\"75 Sean Rhyan\"), so a name join against the injury report misses them: 0 of 17 Green Bay injury rows match today, 14 after stripping.",
   "effect": "The Packers' injured starters are under-detected. Stripping the number recovers 14 join(s); the raw string is kept so the cleaning is auditable.",
   "source": "https://www.packers.com/team/depth-chart"
  },
  {
   "id": "DP-02",
   "severity": "red",
   "area": "Packers depth",
   "finding": "33 cell(s) differ between the live chart and the published store (0 printed on the live chart but absent from the store, 2 in the store but not on the live chart).",
   "effect": "Stripping the number is necessary but not sufficient: the store is also incomplete and in places contradicted, so it must be re-captured with the date the club prints (\"Unofficial, Nov. 10, 2026\") recorded on every row.",
   "source": "https://www.packers.com/team/depth-chart"
  },
  {
   "id": "DP-03",
   "severity": "amber",
   "area": "Packers depth",
   "finding": "3 Green Bay player(s) on the official injury report are printed nowhere on the club's depth chart: Chris Brooks, Micah Parsons, Skyy Moore.",
   "effect": "They are either on injured reserve, on the practice squad, or omitted from the chart. The source does not say which, so no reason is recorded \u2014 the absence is published as an absence, and each of those players is unpriced by the availability model.",
   "source": "https://www.packers.com/team/depth-chart"
  },
  {
   "id": "DP-04",
   "severity": "amber",
   "area": "Texans depth",
   "finding": "The Texans chart is served as an image. Nothing on the page can be parsed as text.",
   "effect": "Houston has no published depth slot. A Houston starter ruled out cannot be matched to a replacement string, so the deficiency register is silent on one of 32 clubs \u2014 silence that must not be read as 'no deficiency'.",
   "source": "https://www.houstontexans.com/team/depth-chart"
  },
  {
   "id": "DP-05",
   "severity": "amber",
   "area": "Depth provenance",
   "finding": "Every club chart is labelled 'Unofficial' by the club that publishes it (Green Bay prints \"Unofficial, Nov. 10, 2026\").",
   "effect": "A depth row is a club self-report at a dated moment. It cannot be treated as a league fact and it must carry the club's own date, not the date we fetched it.",
